WEBVTT

00:02:56.255 --> 00:03:00.259
Are we representing them
with dignity and fairness?

00:03:00.301 --> 00:03:04.138
Are we telling the whole story
or just a part of it?

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:09.852
I'm very conscious about stereotypes
and how I represent people.

00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:15.524
Life can be harsh for poor girls
from these countries.

00:03:16.442 --> 00:03:19.111
Boys are given preferential treatment,

00:03:19.153 --> 00:03:22.573
while girls are expected
to do household chores --

00:03:22.615 --> 00:03:25.451
cook, clean, fetch water,

00:03:25.493 --> 00:03:27.662
and take care of their younger siblings.

00:03:28.246 --> 00:03:32.667
Often, parents tend to marry
their daughters early